Z||000004||OcalaFiero||09-25-2001||12:31 PM||||the 22P is the GM parts book for the Fiero. A great investment as it is illustrated and shows parts locations etc. They show up on Ebay from time to time, and are usually pretty overpriced.<P>Mike<BR>||||reg||1
